Package: tdaR
Type: Package
Title: Transition Data Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Goetz", "Rohwer", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Ulrich", "Poetter", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Jan Marvin", "Garbuszus", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jan.garbuszus@ruhr-uni-bochum.de"))
Description: An R interface to 'TDA' 6.4, Goetz Rohwer's and Ulrich Poetter's
    program for transition data analysis, built into the package as a library.
    Its event history and transition rate models, regression, sequence,
    cluster, graph and spatial methods and its matrix language are available
    as R functions that take data frames and return R objects. The package
    keeps the program and its methods usable and documented, and reproduces
    results obtained with 'TDA'.
URL: https://github.com/JanMarvin/TDA, https://janmarvin.github.io/TDA, https://www.stat.rub.de/tda.html
BugReports: https://github.com/JanMarvin/TDA/issues
